WEBVTT

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:02.810
Chara-su!

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:04.900
Is everyone shugo-peppy today?

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:07.870
It's time to start Shugo Chara Party!

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:10.620
30 minutes chock full of shugo-cute anime!

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:12.020
We hope you enjoy them!

00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:13.700
Everyone's hearts:

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:14.890
Unlock!

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.450
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:20.960
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:24.760
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:26.630
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:28.480
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:30.360
you're like a dream.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:32.210
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:34.100
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:35.940
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:37.740
it's like I'm dreaming.

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:41.540
Whenever I start something new

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:45.250
I get really excited,

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:48.920
though I pretend like it's nothing at all.

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:52.060
I've always been stubborn like that.

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:59.700
I think it'd be nice if I could just be honest with myself.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:03.490
But it's hard, you know?

00:01:03.490 --> 00:01:07.620
I'll try working on it bit by bit.

00:01:08.230 --> 00:01:12.240
It's party time!

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:15.990
Someday I'll transform into someone brand new.

00:01:15.990 --> 00:01:19.730
But for now, I want to forget everything else

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.930
and discover all of the potential in me.

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:27.140
It's party time!

00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:30.850
That brand new me is out there somewhere.

00:01:30.850 --> 00:01:34.360
But for now, I just want to stay as I am

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:38.990
and find all of the things I can be.

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:40.950
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:51.060
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:53.440
"Yoru's Pranks!"

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:57.880
Oh, you showed up-nya!

00:01:57.880 --> 00:01:59.590
What did you want of me?

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:02.140
I daresay you have something afoot...

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:04.810
What is this chair?

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:07.850
Just a reward since I usually tease you all the time-nya.

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:09.590
Yoru, I misjudged you!

00:02:09.590 --> 00:02:11.400
It seems you have had a change of heart.

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:14.120
Well, just have a seat-nya.

00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:16.440
Indeed. Then, if you don't mind...

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:20.960
Oh! It is soft and cushiony; it makes me feel like I could sit in it forever!

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:23.150
This is indeed a chair fit for a King!

00:02:23.150 --> 00:02:25.690
I'm glad you like it-nya.

00:02:25.690 --> 00:02:27.400
Well, later-nya!

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:28.960
Yes! You have my thanks!

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:34.350
I must show myself sitting in this chair to the others.

00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:36.700
Okay, I shall call someone-

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:39.420
What is this trickery?!

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:43.050
Rubber Glue

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:51.440
Huh? The paint isn't coming out...

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:53.810
Paint

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:56.690
Go, gogo, Shugo Bomber...

00:02:57.100 --> 00:03:00.340
Someone put paint on my cleaning cloth!

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:03.160
I got you all big time-nya!

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:04.050
You knave!

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:05.080
Come back here!

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:06.470
Wait!

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:08.240
If you put it that way...

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:10.150
...I'd better skedaddle-nya!

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:12.360
Come and chase me!

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:17.240
I can feel his presence around here.

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:18.390
We search!

00:03:18.390 --> 00:03:19.790
Yes!

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.230
Where is he hiding?

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:32.350
Right here-nya!

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:36.330
Hey you!

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:38.340
Wait!

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:46.950
No! My egg!

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:49.620
That's because you played all those pranks.

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:51.530
Serves you right.

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:57.290
I feel sorry for him. Let's fix it.

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:58.920
Yes, let's.

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:03.450
Rejoice, for we have repaired it!

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:06.010
We spiffed it up a bit, though.

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:08.410
Th-Thank you-nya...

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:10.360
It is good you accept our kindness.

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:13.330
How'd it turn out like this-nya?!

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:13.940
See you again!

00:04:14.860 --> 00:04:16.610
Shugo Chara Encyclopedia!

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:18.250
Character Introductions!

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:20.630
The first person we'll introduce today is...

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:22.970
Fujisaki Nagihiko!

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:29.280
Nagihiko is the Jack's Chair of the Seiyo Academy Guardians!

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:32.750
He's a beautiful boy with silky long hair!

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:39.210
He's kind, and always gives advice to Amu-chan and the others whenever they are worried about something.

00:04:39.510 --> 00:04:41.420
He's also really good at basketball.

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:51.860
Continuing with the second person...

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:54.480
Fujisaki Nadeshiko!

00:04:56.740 --> 00:05:00.270
Nadeshiko is the former Queen's Chair in the Guardians.

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:06.440
She had gone to study abroad in Europe to further her skills in traditional Japanese dance.

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:12.000
Nadeshiko is actually Nagihiko, Amu-chan doesn't know this yet.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:15.100
She thinks Nadeshiko and Nagihiko are twins.

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:20.200
We'll continue doing these Shugo Chara Encyclopedia introductions every week!

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:21.720
Look forward to it!

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:28.050
Shugo Shugo Egg Battle!

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:32.420
Today we're going to announce the results!

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:36.580
Okay, my little eggs, you've done 8 Egg Battles up until now.

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:37.960
Good job!

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:40.820
We did our best!

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:44.090
And so, I'll announce the overall results!

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:45.320
Okay!

00:05:46.230 --> 00:05:50.290
Amulet Clover won the first and last battle...

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:53.970
You got three points!

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:55.510
Yay!

00:05:56.500 --> 00:06:00.100
Amulet Spade who won every touch and feel battle...

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.340
You got four points!

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:10.940
And Amulet Heart, the chopsticks wizard south-paw...

00:06:12.860 --> 00:06:14.460
You got five points!

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:15.390
Yippee!

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:16.590
Yay!

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:19.270
And so, the grand winner is...

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:20.920
Amulet Heart!

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:22.620
Yippee!

00:06:23.870 --> 00:06:29.860
In honor of your victory, we present to you a special Shugo Chara Cake!

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:29.860
It looks delicious!

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:31.730
Aww, you're so lucky...

00:06:31.730 --> 00:06:34.710
We'll start new games next week!

00:06:33.980 --> 00:06:35.460
I want some...

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:37.350
Hey, hey! Are you listening?

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:45.540
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:48.520
"The Ghost of the Royal Garden"

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:56.810
A mysterious hole of horror that appeared at some point in the Royal Garden.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:59.310
Night after night, from within this hole...

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:02.810
...can be heard a sobbing voice.

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:05.810
I-I'm scared!

00:07:05.810 --> 00:07:08.250
Maybe there's a ghost?

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:12.410
In order to find out, I have gathered you all here.

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:14.670
W-We're going inside?

00:07:14.670 --> 00:07:16.730
What if a ghost appears?

00:07:16.730 --> 00:07:19.660
Don't be silly. There's no such thing as ghosts.

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:20.460
Yes, there is!

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:23.640
I've heard Mr. Ghost's sobbing!

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:24.990
Me, too!

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:26.110
*sob* *sob*

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:27.360
*sob* *sob*

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:30.770
A crying voice, as sad and cold as ice itself...

00:07:31.570 --> 00:07:33.840
I said there's no such thing as ghosts!

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:36.520
If you want, I'll go exorcise it!

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:37.970
Really?

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:40.980
Sure thing. If it really exists, that is.

00:07:41.650 --> 00:07:42.750
And so...

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:45.360
Why am I in front?

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:47.500
You're the one that doesn't believe in ghosts!

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:50.310
If you don't believe in them, then you shouldn't be scared!

00:07:50.310 --> 00:07:52.200
Of c-course I'm not scared!

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:53.490
Wait!

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:54.990
Can't you hear something?

00:07:58.450 --> 00:07:59.940
I can hear a voice!

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:01.080
Desu!

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:03.010
It's just the wind...

00:08:03.010 --> 00:08:05.270
There's no such thing as...

00:08:05.270 --> 00:08:06.510
I can hear something!

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:07.600
Desu!

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:09.790
It's a crying voice, cold as ice!

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:10.960
Miki, check it out!

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:12.250
Why me?

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:14.620
You said you weren't scared!

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:24.640
It sounds like it's coming from in here.

00:08:24.640 --> 00:08:26.600
That's Mr. Ghost's house!

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:27.870
Miki, exorcise it!

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:29.020
Evil spirits, begone!

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:30.430
Evil spirits, begone!

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:34.400
Evil spirits, begone!

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:36.130
Evil spirits, begone!

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:38.200
There's no such thing...

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:39.550
There's no such thing...

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:41.740
...as ghosts!

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:45.050
A ghost!!

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:52.680
What's the matter, everybody?

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:54.820
So it was you, El?

00:08:54.820 --> 00:08:56.500
You ran away from home again?

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:58.920
Il always teases me!

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:02.050
I'm never going home again!

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:09.560
See you again!

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:13.150
Coming up next is Shugo Chara Dokki Doki!

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:16.900
This week's episode is "What? Tadase-kun has a crush on someone?!"

00:09:16.900 --> 00:09:19.730
Amu-chan is heartbroken?

00:09:19.730 --> 00:09:20.510
No way!

00:09:20.510 --> 00:09:21.530
It couldn't be!

00:09:21.530 --> 00:09:23.290
You can do it, Amu-chan!

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:40.350
What's really important?

00:09:41.610 --> 00:09:46.400
Well, it's white and round and sunny,

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:53.660
and even if they don't know it, everyone has one in their heart.

00:09:54.940 --> 00:10:05.000
The faith I have in others is what keeps me going.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:09.720
Guardian Eggs and X Eggs, Guardian Characters and X Characters...

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:14.090
They're all precious things.

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:18.260
And so, Open Heart, go!

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:19.790
Everything'll be okay.

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:22.850
Because even if you feel lost,

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:26.280
you're not alone.

00:10:26.280 --> 00:10:28.440
We'll always be together.

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:31.080
And when I think of that, somehow,

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:34.110
I feel warm and fuzzy inside.

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:37.290
Open Heart, now!

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:38.950
You can see the eggs, right?

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:43.960
They're smiling and bouncing around.

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:49.800
So from now on, forever and ever...

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:52.020
I'll be counting on you!

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:01.010
Huh?

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:03.490
It's Tadase-kun and Kukai...

00:11:03.490 --> 00:11:05.130
Well, look at that.

00:11:05.590 --> 00:11:08.680
Looks like they're having a serious discussion about something.

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:10.940
Let's listen in...

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:11.920
Hey! Eavesdropping isn't-

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:13.960
Maybe they're talking about love!

00:11:13.960 --> 00:11:16.620
Love! This could be a big scoop!

00:11:16.620 --> 00:11:17.460
Wait...

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:19.420
They're hopeless.

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:21.100
I'll bring them back.

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:24.710
It's not that I'm interested or anything.

00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:25.920
Really.

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:30.250
Dia, you too?

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:31.460
Love?

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:34.350
Ah, I see.

00:11:34.350 --> 00:11:37.110
But in the end it's up to your own feelings.

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:37.790
Yeah...

00:11:37.790 --> 00:11:38.910
Let's go.

00:11:38.910 --> 00:11:41.040
She's really cute.

00:11:41.870 --> 00:11:45.340
When I think about her, I can't sleep at night.

00:11:47.380 --> 00:11:48.710
Then take the plunge!

00:11:48.710 --> 00:11:50.140
I can't!

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:52.350
You can't just give up before saying anything to her!

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:56.060
If you show her how passionate you are about this, I'm sure she'll say okay!

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:57.520
Maybe...

00:11:57.820 --> 00:12:00.460
I'll help you out.

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:01.620
Thank you.

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:04.610
You're really the one to talk to about these things, Soma-kun.

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:05.870
Got that right!

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:08.100
Just leave this kind of advice to me.

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:09.070
Amu-chan!

00:12:09.070 --> 00:12:10.770
Get a hold of yourself!

00:12:10.060 --> 00:12:13.910
10 - What? Tadase-kun has a crush on someone?!

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:12.020
Stay strong!

00:12:12.020 --> 00:12:13.910
Amu-chan, get a grip!

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:17.510
She's acting weird.

00:12:17.510 --> 00:12:19.960
Yeah, I wonder what happened?

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:21.690
Who could it be?

00:12:21.690 --> 00:12:22.630
Who could <i>what</i> be?

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:23.900
You know who we're talking about.

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:26.820
The cute girl Tadase-kun was talking about.

00:12:26.820 --> 00:12:30.350
Wh-Why should I care?

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:35.160
My poor Amu-chan, having her heart broken so young...

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:36.390
Don't, Su!

00:12:36.390 --> 00:12:40.110
No matter how obvious it is, it is just too sad to say it aloud!

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:40.970
That's right!

00:12:40.970 --> 00:12:44.510
We have to wait to console her until after Tadase-kun dumps her definitively!

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:48.910
Oh yeah? Well maybe I don't need any of your <i>consoling</i>... Thought of that?

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:53.380
So you don't care if Tadase-kun has another girl he likes?

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:56.810
Yeah, fine!

00:12:56.810 --> 00:12:58.170
See if I care!

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:00.370
Don't have nothin' to do with me, nope!

00:13:00.940 --> 00:13:03.200
How brave of you, Amu-chan!

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:05.820
I cannot comprehend her actions.

00:13:05.820 --> 00:13:07.430
Yo!

00:13:09.390 --> 00:13:11.010
I came over to hang out!

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:14.880
Wait, could you be the former Jack, Kukai-senpai?

00:13:14.880 --> 00:13:17.140
I heard about you from Yaya-senpai!

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:20.550
The upperclassman with all the free time who always stops by.

00:13:20.550 --> 00:13:24.460
Damn you, Yaya!

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:26.130
It's not just 'cause he's free.

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:29.050
He gives us advice on all kinds of things.

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:30.230
That's right!

00:13:30.230 --> 00:13:33.450
Like, today I advised Tadase-kun about this cute little thing...

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:34.790
Suppose so...

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:37.440
Suppose so...

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:38.800
Suppose so...

00:13:38.800 --> 00:13:40.340
Suppose so...

00:13:44.810 --> 00:13:46.090
Amu-chan!

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:47.870
Don't console yourself with food!

00:13:47.870 --> 00:13:51.970
I'm not! These snacks are just so tasty!

00:13:52.420 --> 00:13:53.610
Amu-chan...

00:13:53.610 --> 00:13:55.640
She must be in total shock...

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:59.770
Now that I think about it, I wonder what type of girl it is that Tadase-kun likes?

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:01.330
I know it might...

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:03.180
...not be of any use...

00:14:03.180 --> 00:14:05.410
But we have to find out!

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:07.920
Amu-chan, let's go find out!

00:14:07.920 --> 00:14:09.870
Man, snacks are yummy!

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:10.920
She's out of it.

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:12.260
Yay, snacks!

00:14:10.920 --> 00:14:13.540
Let's just go ourselves.

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:14.470
Right!

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:33.310
Who is this girl?

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:34.420
She has a pretty face.

00:14:34.420 --> 00:14:36.100
Tadase-kun really has...

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:37.750
...another girl he likes.

00:14:37.750 --> 00:14:39.310
What is it, citizens?

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:41.240
Have you come for a visit?

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:42.910
I apologize, but we already have a-

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:44.550
How could you?!

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:46.440
Desu!

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:47.860
Wh-What?

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:50.900
Why are they angry?

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:58.160
Tadase-kun?

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:10.670
Hello?

00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:12.500
Bonsoir.

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:14.970
What? Who is this?

00:15:15.270 --> 00:15:16.930
Always with the cold shoulder.

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:18.680
Have you forgotten my voice already?

00:15:21.720 --> 00:15:22.940
Ikuto?!

00:15:23.240 --> 00:15:24.160
Correct!

00:15:24.160 --> 00:15:25.800
It's been a while-nya!

00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:26.880
Are you doing well?

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:28.940
Sure. Well...

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:31.250
Well what?

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:32.910
Tadase dump you or something?

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:34.370
Hit the mark

00:15:35.020 --> 00:15:36.370
Seriously?

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:40.170
I-It seems he found a girl he likes or something...

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:42.400
He said she was really cute!

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:45.560
I'd console you if I was there.

00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:46.280
Huh?

00:15:46.280 --> 00:15:49.460
I'd kiss you, and hug you, and everything else...

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:55.570
You just blushed now, didn't you?

00:15:56.150 --> 00:15:57.930
What are you saying, you pervert!

00:15:58.180 --> 00:16:00.090
Why did you call me, anyway?

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:01.050
Later.

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:03.380
H-Hey!

00:16:07.350 --> 00:16:09.300
What is <i>with</i> him!

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:10.070
Amu-chan!

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:13.470
It's true! There was a girl at Tadase-kun's house!

00:16:18.760 --> 00:16:23.380
Enough, I don't understand this AT ALL!

00:16:24.550 --> 00:16:28.340
Amu-chan, are you sure about asking Tadase-kun directly?

00:16:28.640 --> 00:16:29.480
Yeah!

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:32.010
It's stupid to just think it over and over!

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:35.920
True. There's no point in postponing the sad truth.

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:38.220
We'll throw you a party to cheer you up when we get home!

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:39.870
I'll bake you a heartbreak cake.

00:16:39.870 --> 00:16:40.850
You guys!

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:41.890
Amu-chan!

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:44.350
What are you doing?

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:47.450
You went home yesterday all of a sudden, is something wrong?

00:16:44.950 --> 00:16:48.220
Now that it's come to it... I'm scared.

00:16:47.450 --> 00:16:50.020
Soma-kun was worried as well.

00:16:50.020 --> 00:16:51.730
Um, um...

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:54.420
Tadase, I sense an X Egg!

00:16:58.230 --> 00:17:01.150
Hikaru, go get Amu-senpai and the others!

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:02.850
Why don't you go yourself?

00:17:02.850 --> 00:17:04.550
Say what?!

00:17:04.550 --> 00:17:07.470
I'm older than you, you know!

00:17:07.470 --> 00:17:10.910
Hey, this is no time to be fighting!

00:17:10.910 --> 00:17:12.300
Stand back, you two!

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:14.110
Amu-senpai!

00:17:14.110 --> 00:17:15.820
Tadase, Character Transform!

00:17:15.820 --> 00:17:16.770
Right!

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:17.560
Us too!

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:18.220
Yeah!

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:20.980
My heart:

00:17:20.980 --> 00:17:22.240
My heart:

00:17:22.240 --> 00:17:23.430
Unlock!

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:41.760
Character Transformation: Platinum Royal!

00:17:44.970 --> 00:17:47.260
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:53.070
Holy Crown!

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:57.760
Rikka, what is it saying?

00:17:58.580 --> 00:18:01.180
It said it was dumped by the person it likes!

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:04.430
It says it hurts, and it never wants to fall in love again!

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:05.890
I understand!

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:08.190
If you've been dumped by someone, just...

00:18:16.090 --> 00:18:17.870
Amu-chan!

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:19.280
Hold it together!

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:20.530
You can do it, Amu-chan!

00:18:21.840 --> 00:18:23.600
If you've been dumped...

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:24.580
If you've been dumped...

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:27.540
If you've been dumped...

00:18:30.690 --> 00:18:33.170
It really hurts being dumped, doesn't it?

00:18:33.780 --> 00:18:35.230
Um, Amu-chan...

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:37.630
This is undignified behavior for the main character.

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:38.960
That's not true!

00:18:42.450 --> 00:18:46.770
It's not right to give up on love just because you were dumped!

00:18:47.690 --> 00:18:49.480
Tadase-kun...

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:52.230
Maybe you don't understand the feelings of the person you like.

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:55.280
And maybe they fall in love with someone else.

00:18:55.280 --> 00:19:02.910
But just by seeing them smiling and enjoying themselves, you can feel a happiness yourself!

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:08.300
So, you mustn't put an X on anyone's feelings of love!

00:19:11.690 --> 00:19:13.380
Right, Amu-chan?

00:19:19.960 --> 00:19:22.720
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:26.190
Open Heart!

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:44.740
A puppy?

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:47.570
Yeah. I picked her up the other day.

00:19:47.570 --> 00:19:49.950
I can't keep her at my house right now,

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:54.370
so I spoke to Soma-kun and he found a foster home for her.

00:19:55.270 --> 00:19:57.800
She was so cute, I couldn't go to sleep.

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:00.860
A cute girl?

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:02.030
He couldn't sleep?

00:20:02.030 --> 00:20:03.270
So it was a puppy.

00:20:03.270 --> 00:20:07.360
Then the girl who came with Kukai-san to Tadase-kun's house last night was...

00:20:07.360 --> 00:20:08.370
Correct.

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:10.720
I am ecstatic that we were able to find such a kind foster home!

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:14.720
I so totally had the wrong idea!

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:16.150
Wrong idea?

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:19.750
Uh, never mind.

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:23.660
I love you, Amu-chan.

00:20:28.430 --> 00:20:29.830
Thank you.

00:20:30.400 --> 00:20:31.520
Couldn't be better!

00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:32.150
Yeah!

00:20:32.150 --> 00:20:33.120
Desu!

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:34.730
Everything's great!

00:20:34.730 --> 00:20:37.860
You've all been acting funny since last night.

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:41.600
What was it?

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:44.510
Clueless Kiseki wouldn't understand.

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:45.520
That's right.

00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:47.640
The heart of a lady is very complicated.

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:49.760
I don't understand at all.

00:20:50.800 --> 00:20:52.520
Great!

00:20:56.120 --> 00:20:58.230
It's time for Guardian Egg Fortune-Telling!

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:01.490
Choose one of the four eggs!

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:06.340
Which eggs will be the lucky ones?

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:12.280
Guardian Egg Friendship Fortune!

00:21:12.280 --> 00:21:14.370
First, for those who chose Ran:

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:15.690
Four Shugoluck Stars!

00:21:15.690 --> 00:21:17.380
Super Lucky!

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:20.300
You might get a present from a friend that'll cheer you up!

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:22.330
Don't forget to say thank you!

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:25.400
Miki's egg gets three Shugoluck Stars.

00:21:25.400 --> 00:21:28.320
You might get closer to a person you thought you didn't like.

00:21:25.400 --> 00:21:28.320
You could become close friends!

00:21:28.320 --> 00:21:30.010
Su's egg gets two Shugoluck Stars.

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:32.650
You might give advice to a friends.

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:35.880
Finally, for those who chose Dia's egg:

00:21:35.880 --> 00:21:39.100
Um, you get, um... one Shugoluck Star.

00:21:39.100 --> 00:21:43.020
A promise to play with your friends might be canceled!

00:21:43.020 --> 00:21:46.380
Your lucky item is a pillow!

00:21:43.020 --> 00:21:46.680
Take the opportunity to bond with your family!

00:21:49.760 --> 00:21:54.570
Shugo Chara Egg! Amulet Diamond Audition Report!

00:21:58.020 --> 00:22:01.740
Finally, we've decided on our Amulet Diamond!

00:22:02.700 --> 00:22:07.080
With over 300 contenders, the girl chosen as Diamond is...

00:22:07.080 --> 00:22:08.350
This girl!

00:22:10.020 --> 00:22:11.670
Chara-su!

00:22:13.300 --> 00:22:15.050
Diamond, congratulations!

00:22:15.050 --> 00:22:18.280
I present to everyone, Amulet Diamond!

00:22:18.280 --> 00:22:20.950
Now, introduce yourself, 'kay?

00:22:20.950 --> 00:22:21.630
Okay!

00:22:21.630 --> 00:22:23.540
I'm Nanami, Amulet Diamond!

00:22:21.860 --> 00:22:27.270
Tanabe Nanami

00:22:23.540 --> 00:22:25.780
I'll do my best at singing and talking!

00:22:25.780 --> 00:22:27.270
Let's be friends!

00:22:28.770 --> 00:22:29.980
You can do it!

00:22:29.980 --> 00:22:31.280
Now all four of us are together!

00:22:31.280 --> 00:22:31.910
Awesome!

00:22:32.240 --> 00:22:34.200
Okay, Diamond. It's time for your first job!

00:22:34.200 --> 00:22:35.000
Okay!

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:36.280
All four together now...

00:22:36.280 --> 00:22:37.810
Okay!

00:22:37.810 --> 00:22:39.880
Stay tuned for next week's Shugo Chara Party!

00:22:39.880 --> 00:22:43.340
Lock On: Open Heart!

00:22:43.340 --> 00:22:44.950
Bye-bye!

00:22:44.950 --> 00:22:48.090
Diamond will try all kinds of things starting next time!

00:22:48.090 --> 00:22:49.220
Cheer her on, 'kay?

00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:58.050
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!

00:23:13.550 --> 00:23:18.710
Let's put our hands together for you! Yes, you!

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:22.590
Let's put our hands together! That's what I wanna do!

00:23:25.140 --> 00:23:30.290
Now put your hands together for me! Yes, me!

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:34.100
Now put your hands together! It's what you should do!

00:23:34.700 --> 00:23:40.080
When I first heard your big dream,

00:23:40.080 --> 00:23:45.480
it was like I was whisked away to another place!

00:23:46.340 --> 00:23:52.690
So, I only know a tiny sliver of the world,

00:23:52.690 --> 00:23:56.780
but at least you're here to talk to me.

00:23:56.780 --> 00:24:02.840
Hey! When I saw that look, that serious attitude...

00:24:02.840 --> 00:24:09.100
Before I knew it, my heart was all aflutter!

00:24:09.100 --> 00:24:10.190
Bravo!

00:24:10.840 --> 00:24:14.650
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!
